{"id":"b86b211a75cf1748","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-godel-numbering.md","title":"Gödel Numbering","display":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-godel-numbering","aliases":["90-df-godel-numbering"],"display":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering","depends_on":["[[90-df-base-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-godel-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-godel-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89af15c7a7c96cb\" href=\"?note=b89af15c7a7c96cb\" title=\"90-df-base-godel-numbering\">90-df-base-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8f303a307372354c\" href=\"?note=8f303a307372354c\" title=\"90-df-encoding\">90-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的表示在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a> 意义下固定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的固定词表示取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8f303a307372354c\" href=\"?note=8f303a307372354c\" title=\"90-df-encoding\">90-df-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\mapsto\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)\">\\(n\\mapsto\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)\\)</span>；与通常二进制展开的转换双向可计算。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span>，则要求给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffSig}(S,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{EffSig}(S,\\eta)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的语法树表示及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a> 的带类型载体。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E,\\iota_E)\">\\((E,\\iota_E)\\)</span> (effectively presented set of finite syntactic expressions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:E\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:E\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (encoding map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup E\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup E\\)</span> (partial decoder)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Effective}\\)</span> (effectivity relative to the fixed presentations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\)</span> (recursive unary-relation class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_E\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_E\\)</span> (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span> 的实例中，固定表示明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_E=\\operatorname{ExprWord}_{S,\\eta}\">\\(\\iota_E=\\operatorname{ExprWord}_{S,\\eta}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExprWord}\">\\(\\operatorname{ExprWord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Effective}(g)\">\\(\\operatorname{Effective}(g)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Effective}(d)\">\\(\\operatorname{Effective}(d)\\)</span> 的输入／输出表示分别随各自类型取得，不依赖 Remark 的省略约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\ng:E\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\n\\land \\operatorname{ran}(g)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\n\\land \\mathrm{Effective}(g)\n\\land \\mathrm{Effective}(d)\n\\land \\operatorname{dom}(d)=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\n\\land \\forall a\\in E\\;d(g(a))=a\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\ng:E\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\n\\land \\operatorname{ran}(g)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\n\\land \\mathrm{Effective}(g)\n\\land \\mathrm{Effective}(d)\n\\land \\operatorname{dom}(d)=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\n\\land \\forall a\\in E\\;d(g(a))=a\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的单射性给出唯一编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 只在合法编码上定义，因而不会把部分逆误写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上的全函数。</li>\n<li>合法编码集合可判定、编码与解码有效，是本书后续语法算法所需的“有效 Gödel 编号”约定。</li>\n<li>上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b89af15c7a7c96cb\" href=\"?note=b89af15c7a7c96cb\" title=\"90-df-base-godel-numbering\">90-df-base-godel-numbering</a> 给出特定语法环境中的编号约定；这里只比较所列有效性条件，不将两个谓词认作同一接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\\)</span> 是通用表示空间上的有效单射／部分逆条件。它不是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b89af15c7a7c96cb\" href=\"?note=b89af15c7a7c96cb\" title=\"90-df-base-godel-numbering\">90-df-base-godel-numbering</a> 中特定语法载体及操作条件的接口别名，也不自动保证任何操作原始递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[E]\">\\(g[E]\\)</span> 外无定义，在该值域内由单射性唯一决定；不得在未通过成员测试时应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-base-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b89af15c7a7c96cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-base-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"8f303a307372354c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E$ 的表示在 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 意义下固定；$\\mathbb N$ 的固定词表示取 [[90-df-encoding]] 的 $n\\mapsto\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)$；与通常二进制展开的转换双向可计算。若 $E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)$，则要求给定 $\\operatorname{EffSig}(S,\\eta)$，采用 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的语法树表示及 [[90-df-formula]] 的带类型载体。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"8f303a307372354c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E$ 的表示在 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 意义下固定；$\\mathbb N$ 的固定词表示取 [[90-df-encoding]] 的 $n\\mapsto\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)$；与通常二进制展开的转换双向可计算。若 $E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)$，则要求给定 $\\operatorname{EffSig}(S,\\eta)$，采用 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的语法树表示及 [[90-df-formula]] 的带类型载体。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E$ 的表示在 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 意义下固定；$\\mathbb N$ 的固定词表示取 [[90-df-encoding]] 的 $n\\mapsto\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)$；与通常二进制展开的转换双向可计算。若 $E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)$，则要求给定 $\\operatorname{EffSig}(S,\\eta)$，采用 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的语法树表示及 [[90-df-formula]] 的带类型载体。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E$ 的表示在 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 意义下固定；$\\mathbb N$ 的固定词表示取 [[90-df-encoding]] 的 $n\\mapsto\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)$；与通常二进制展开的转换双向可计算。若 $E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)$，则要求给定 $\\operatorname{EffSig}(S,\\eta)$，采用 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的语法树表示及 [[90-df-formula]] 的带类型载体。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Effective}$ (effectivity relative to the fixed presentations, see [[90-df-effective-procedure]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecPred}_1$ (recursive unary-relation class, see [[90-df-recursive-function-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 $E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)$ 的实例中，固定表示明确为 $\\iota_E=\\operatorname{ExprWord}_{S,\\eta}$，其中 $\\operatorname{ExprWord}$ 见 [[90-df-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Effective}(g)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Effective}(d)$ 的输入／输出表示分别随各自类型取得，不依赖 Remark 的省略约定。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-base-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b89af15c7a7c96cb","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"上游 [[90-df-base-godel-numbering]] 给出特定语法环境中的编号约定；这里只比较所列有效性条件，不将两个谓词认作同一接口。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-base-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b89af15c7a7c96cb","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里的 $\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)$ 是通用表示空间上的有效单射／部分逆条件。它不是 [[90-df-base-godel-numbering]] 中特定语法载体及操作条件的接口别名，也不自动保证任何操作原始递归。$d$ 在 $g[E]$ 外无定义，在该值域内由单射性唯一决定；不得在未通过成员测试时应用 $d$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\mapsto\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EffSig}(S,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"(E,\\iota_E)","display":false},{"tex":"g:E\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Effective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_E","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_E=\\operatorname{ExprWord}_{S,\\eta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExprWord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Effective}(g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Effective}(d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\ng:E\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\n\\land \\operatorname{ran}(g)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\n\\land \\mathrm{Effective}(g)\n\\land \\mathrm{Effective}(d)\n\\land \\operatorname{dom}(d)=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\n\\land \\forall a\\in E\\;d(g(a))=a\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"g[E]","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false}],"bytes":2768,"backlinks":[{"id":"5defe8d5249da268","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 与 $\\overline n$ (Gödel 编码与数码, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"fac5c810f5035179","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}$ (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"06f1ec898bae8895","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}$ (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)$ (effective Gödel numbering, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为具有固定有效表示的算术签名，$g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{GN}$ 见 [[90-df-godel-numbering]]。"},{"id":"adc0aa731119457e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5e705f7962c302c2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)$ (effective Gödel numbering with partial decoder, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9f8586e4baa616ce","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N$ and $d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)$ (candidate encoding and partial decoder, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"7eb380164954dfb8","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)$ (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"8d9c15743f7342d2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c4cc1405929acfc1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e57623a088eec9a8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 为固定有效签名，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；固定 $g,d$ 满足 [[90-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)$，并假设 [[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]] 的 $\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)$。"},{"id":"9a1dfd8bac56a4d9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)$ (effective Gödel numbering, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"7c51b51998a67f02","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"af4f7551b0885593","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6763f8a85fa6a7b0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)$ (effective Gödel numbering, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"fb8a113c2891ff19","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $g,d$ 满足 [[90-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)$；数码见 [[90-df-numeral]]，自由代入见 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]。此固定环境不得在调用 $\\mathrm{Sub}_S$ 时更换。"},{"id":"00035e09fe6018d6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee92d67ceb6220d0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 直接取 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]]；存在固定解码器 $d$ 满足 [[90-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})}(g,d)$。本次调用 [[90-df-truth-definition]] 的环境语言就是对象语言 $S^*=S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$。"},{"id":"f63672a7ac0e50d2","anchor